<title>USA: Western Pacific Q1 consolidated shr loss.</title>
<headline>Western Pacific Q1 consolidated shr loss.</headline>
<dateline>COLORADO SPRINGS, Colo. 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $1.33     loss	 $0.18</p>
<p> Net loss		  17,814     loss	 2,443</p>
<p> Oper revenue	    35,817		   33,706</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  13,395		   13,223</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is Western Pacific Airlines Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: Current first quarter earnings are consolidated to account for Western's 57 percent ownership of Mountain Air Express, which began flight operations on December 15, 1996. But consolidated results do not equal the sum of Western Pacific and Mountain Air due to elimination entries and minority interests. Year-ago first quarter represents the results of Western Pacific Airlines.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
